# Floor-guard exemptions (one glob per line). Applies to suppressions and
# stubs only; test skips, thresholds, exception rows and deleted tests are
# never ignorable. Each entry needs a reason it exists.
# The guard's own pattern lists must name the forms they detect, and its
# fixtures must contain them to prove detection.
# Minified island bundles are generated outputs; their one-line diffs can
# reproduce existing empty catches and are reviewed against their source.
public/**
ci/floor-guard.mjs
ci/floor-guard.test.mjs
